Hi,

I just update a RH5.0 for alpha to a RH5.2 for alpha, this was on a jensen
system... ;)
The installer segfaults when you select YES for customizing the package
list but if you select NO then it is ok...
So select NO when the installer asks you if you what to select more
package and then select/unselect the new package with your fresh RH5.2
system by using glint...

BTW glint doesn't work so use xrpm ! ;)

