I have an AGP card with the same chipset running under Intel and it does 
the same thing.  The only way to make it work under Intel is to load RH5.0 
and use the xsuse SVGA server.  Then it runs slick.  The minute I run the 
card under 5.1 and use the xsuse server, I get system crashes and the like. 
 Apparently their is an X app that disagrees with the server or the card. 
You may want to try it and see what happens.

Kevin Wood




