> Now I think about this. I think I'll break the vendors page down into
> several catagories. For Ex:
> 
> 1) Vendors that openly support Alpha Linux
> 2) Vendors that sell system with AL, but don't offer tech support (?)
> 3) Vendors that sell Alpha equipment and not Linux
> 4) Component vendors (SCSI Cards, Network etc..)
> 
