a record of the unfortunate event(s).  I suppose you could strace it
as well, but that would probably give you so much poop that you'd be
wading through it through the next millenium (to say nothing of disk
space)...I wonder if the server isn't aware of cards w/ 8M on them
and you have an address wraparound problem.  That might show up with
the logfile thing.  

