This is very interesting.
I'm running WindowMaker here and it compiled without problems.

Kernel: 2.1.126 Egcs: 1.1b OS: Red Hat 5.0 +patches

picu-sgh:~$ uname -a
Linux picu-sgh.demon.co.uk 2.1.126 #2 Sat Oct 24 22:00:26 BST 1998 alpha unknown
picu-sgh:~$ gcc --version
egcs-2.91.57
