The 21164-533Mhz is not out of production.  The problem is Compaq ordered
some 6,000+ units(533&600Mhz) from both Samsung and Intel.  The end result,
it screwed up OEM channels from getting product.  There are 633Mhz
processors available because of two reasons.  One, can't run on a stock LX.
Second, cost and only runs on the UX.  Once all the issues with the UX and
Linux get resolved we will offer the UX with a 533, 600, 633 and 667Mhz
Alpha processors.

