>OK. That explains this device I think:
>
>  Bus  0, device   1, function  0:
>    PCI bridge: Intel Unknown device (rev 2).
>      Vendor id=8086. Device id=7191.
>      Medium devsel.  Master Capable.  Latency=64.  Min Gnt=128.
